<title>UK: Ahold USA Inc sets 500 mln guilder 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>Ahold USA Inc sets 500 mln guilder 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager ABN AMRO Hoare Govett.</p>
<p> BORROWER   AHOLD USA INC</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  ROYAL AHOLD NV</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    28.NOV.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.505   PAY DATE    28.NOV.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.93     SPREAD	+35 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	DENOMS (K) 5-10-100-1M  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    =	   HOME CTRY  =	   TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES	SPREAD OVER THE CURVE, 42 BPOVER JUNE 2006</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
